# Tank UDT - Storage vessel with level and temp
@tank|Tank|1.0|equipment
>name|str||1
>capacity|float|1000|0
>units|str|gal|0
~level|float|Tank level|%|0|100
~volume|float|Volume|gal|0|10000
~temp|float|Temperature|°C|-40|200
~pressure|float|Pressure|psi|0|150
=normal|#3b82f6|#3b82f6|0
=low|#f59e0b|#f59e0b|0
=high|#f59e0b|#f59e0b|0
=alarm|#ef4444|#ef4444|1
